SUMMARY:RUIDOSA INMUNDICIA (aut/chl) + SELFISH (fin) + LARMA (swe) + NUCLEAR CULT (ger) + MASSGRAV (swe) + STATUS SYMBOL (dk) (Uhrzeit prüfen)
LOCATION:Arena
DESCRIPTION: | Arena Wien - Kleine Halle | Ruidosa Inmundicia Farewell Party  Ruidosa Inmundicia is saying goodbye. We invite you to join our farewell party with friends and bands we met in the past 23 years. Let's have a blast! https://ruidosainmundicia.bandcamp.com/   Selfish: The european kings of japanese-style "Burning Spirits" Hardcore Punk from Turku\, Finland. Formed in 1989\, and their first time in Vienna since 2004.   https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=P9bWddCAsTw&t=501s   Larma: Swedish Hardcore Punk from Malmö. Considering their members past bands like Skitkids or Infernöh\, they know how to deliver the "Kängpunk".  https://beachimpedimentrecords.bandcamp.com/album/larma   Nuclear Cult: Berlin based fast and no bullshit Hardcore Punk veterans coming from bands like Y\, Solid Decline\, SM-70 or Pink Flamingos\, with decades of experience in extreme Hardcore.  https://nuclearcult.bandcamp.com/   Massgrav: 30 years of Rock'n'Roll infused Hardcore Punk - fast\, intense and fun\, from Stockholm\, Sweden.  https://massgrav.bandcamp.com/  Status Symbol: Newest branch on the K-Town Hardcore family tree. Fast melodic Hardcore\, inspired by early USHC classics\, dedicated to stirring trouble in the pit!   Vorverkauf/Presale Arena Shop € 25 (+ € 2\,50 Fee) Abendkasse/Doors tba. 
URL:https://arena.wien/Home/Programm-Detail/concert-id/48579
